/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-37-    topk (int, optional):
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-38-        Number of top tokens to consider for top-k distillation losses.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-39-    use_task_rewards (bool):
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-40-        Whether to include task rewards alongside distillation loss.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-41-    distillation_loss_coef (float):
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-42-        Coefficient for distillation loss when combined with task rewards.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-43-    loss_max_clamp (float, optional):
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-44-        Maximum value to clamp distillation loss. If None, no clamping is applied.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-45-    log_prob_min_clamp (float, optional):
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-46-        Minimum value to clamp log probabilities for stability, e.g., log q - log p where p or q are
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-47-        very close to zero. If None, no clamping is applied.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-48-    use_policy_gradient (bool):
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-49-        Whether to incorporate distillation loss as a reward, as done
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-50-        by https://thinkingmachines.ai/blog/on-policy-distillation/. Recommended to use loss_mode=k1.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-51-        Otherwise, distillation loss is directly backpropagated as a supervised loss,
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-52-        as in https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.13649. Recommended to use loss_mode=k3 or forward_kl_topk.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-53-    policy_loss_mode (str):
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-54-        Name of the policy loss to use when use_policy_gradient is true.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-55-    clip_ratio (float):
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-56-        PPO clipping ratio for policy loss.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-57-    clip_ratio_low (float):
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-58-        Lower bound for PPO clipping ratio.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-59-    clip_ratio_high (float):
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-60-        Upper bound for PPO clipping ratio.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-61-    loss_settings (DistillationLossSettings, optional):
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-62-        Runtime-populated settings based on loss_mode. Not set by user.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-63-    """
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-64-
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-65-    loss_mode: str = "k3"
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-66-    topk: Optional[int] = 128
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-67-    use_task_rewards: bool = True
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-68-    distillation_loss_coef: float = 1.0
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-69-    loss_max_clamp: Optional[float] = 10.0
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-70-    log_prob_min_clamp: Optional[float] = -10.0
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-71-
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-72-    # Chunked top-K log-probs (opt-in, avoids [B, T, V] log_softmax buffer
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-73-    # at long context). Only consumed by ``loss_mode='forward_kl_topk'``.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-74-    # Default ``False`` to preserve short-context performance (chunked path
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-75-    # has ~6x time overhead at N=14K, V=152K). Set ``True`` when hitting OOM
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-76-    # at long context (>=64K tokens, V=152K) where the baseline path OOMs.
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-77-    use_chunked_topk: bool = False
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-78-    # Tokens per chunk along (B*T) when ``use_chunked_topk=True``. Larger
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-79-    # chunks reduce kernel-launch overhead but increase per-chunk memory;
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-80-    # smaller chunks reduce per-chunk memory but increase kernel-launch
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-81-    # overhead (saved-tensor total stays constant either way).
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-82-    chunked_topk_chunk_size: int = 4096
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-83-
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-84-    use_policy_gradient: bool = True
/opt/verl/verl/workers/config/distillation.py-85-    policy_loss_mode: str = "vanilla"
